      "message": "fix(examples): restamp the indexed microARC example for the #3100 law\n\nThe four indexed slot operations of first-4axis-part read Stale once:\nthe posed first-traverse law now reads each 3+2 plane on a machine whose\ntable turns the work, and its op stamp takes the #3084 word. The stamp\nvalues come from the test's own path (WRITE_GOLDEN=1); only the three\nstamp fields change, and first-4axis-part.nc stays byte-identical.\n\nThe refused-plane pin reads the verdict, because this rig states no\nnose_to_axis and the index-swing clause refuses the post first.\n\nRefs #3100\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
