        "date": "2026-11-21T13:08:29Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): restamp an op when a user's declaring post takes it\n\nThe stamp read only whether the setup's post declares\nrotariesBeforeTraverse. An op generated under Tormach PathPilot then\nstayed fresh after the setup took a user's copy of the script, and\nposted without the note that the order was taken at its word. A user's\nown declaring script now writes its own stamp word. The declaration\ncache keeps at most 32 script texts.\n\nRefs #3100\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
